  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4342c41f37a5b85438fd2d1c2f0fc4ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoreEnd
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoreSequenceSO
  paragraphs:
  - Finally. the souls in the Limbo can rest, now Minos stands proudly against the
    influence of Lucifer.
  - 'Remiel has been elevated to rank of Archangel, a divine compensation for the
    wrongful banishment to the shadows of Limbo instead of the promised glory of
    Heaven '
  - 'And Godiva,as a reward for guiding Remiel trough the deeps of Limbo, has been
    rewarded with a human life.  '
